The application must support general barcode scanning outside the Attendance Scanner page.
If a barcode is randomly scanned from a general Staff Lookup/Scanner page, DO NOT clock the employee in or out.
Instead, show the full staff profile.
The Staff Profile should include:
Personal Information
•	Full Name
•	Photo
•	Staff Code
•	Gender
