29. DUPLICATE PREVENTION
The system must prevent duplicate:
•	Staff Codes
•	Employee numbers where uniqueness applies
•	Staff records
•	Attendance scans
•	Duplicate rapid barcode scans
Use Firestore transactions where necessary.
Do not rely on random frontend checks alone.
________________________________________
30. TIME HANDLING
Use Firebase/server timestamps where possible rather than trusting the user's local device clock.
Display time in the organization's configured timezone.
Default timezone:
Africa/Kigali
Provide a centralized configuration so this can be changed later.
Be consistent with date boundaries.
Attendance calculations must use the organization's configured timezone rather than blindly using UTC calendar dates.
